  "engine.guide.cloudOwner.step2": "Supabase: the **Project URL** is `https://<project-ref>.supabase.co` (the ref is in your dashboard address) and the **publishable key** (`sb_publishable_…`) is under **Project Settings → API Keys** → put both in **config.js** (or give them to Claude). Never share the secret key or the database password.",
